 "transcript": [
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"And they have not forgotten their father, nor have they forgotten that we are rich men and we should live well. The eldest son has brought home a wife and she is a daughter of a rich man and she is proud and she will have her own way in the house, and my brother has a new wife and she is a woman of great beauty and she is proud also,\"",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung is surprised and asks his son about the women.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and there are enough men and women in the town and there is the woman in the moon. It is not a thing to talk about and I would you, my father, did not speak of it again.\"",
  "[action] The eldest son shows his father the land he wishes to sell.",
  "[action] The eldest son introduces his father to the new wives.",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son shows his father the land he wishes to sell.",
  "[action] The eldest son follows his father to the house.",
  "Wang Lung: \"Well, and I do not know that I want to sell this land,\"",
  "Wang Lung: \"It is my good land.\"",
  "[action] The eldest son presses his father to sell the land.",
  "[action] The eldest son answers his father's doubts about the land's fertility.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung becomes impatient with his son's persistence.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and I suppose you will have your way. Let us go into the house and we will talk of the matter.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung sits and smokes pipe",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son sits at his father's feet.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Now speak your heart, my son!\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"I wish to sell it, father, that we may have the money and I may marry a wife of good family and have a child to carry on the name.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung shakes head",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"I have no mind to marry you off yet. It is too soon. You are not yet twenty years old and you are not worthy of a good woman.\"",
  "[action] The eldest son becomes proud and sulky."
 ],
